 "subs": [
  {
   "a": 1.5299999999999998,
   "b": 10.269,
   "text": "Some prompts read like a quiet request. Some, like a job description. Some, like a room papered with warnings."
  },
  {
   "a": 10.529,
   "b": 17.749,
   "text": "Follow strictly. Omit nothing. Once again: never, ever break the rules."
  },
  {
   "a": 18.038999999999998,
   "b": 22.948,
   "text": "But the history of prompting is not a history of ever more commands."
  },
  {
   "a": 23.208,
   "b": 28.46,
   "text": "It is a boundary between a person and a model, always on the move."
  },
  {
   "a": 28.72,
   "b": 34.324,
   "text": "What must a person spell out? And what can be left to its own judgment?"
  },
  {
   "a": 41.469,
   "b": 47.158,
   "text": "At first, a model did not follow instructions. It could only keep writing."
  },
  {
   "a": 47.268,
   "b": 54.251,
   "text": "So we did what children do with a copybook: write a few lines of examples, then leave one blank."
  },
  {
   "a": 54.361,
   "b": 58.243,
   "text": "The answer was simply the most natural next stroke."
  },
  {
   "a": 61.358,
   "b": 69.36,
   "text": "At the end of 2022, ChatGPT arrived. We could finally just say: please, do this for me."
  },
  {
   "a": 69.47,
   "b": 75.363,
   "text": "So some wrote: you are a world-class expert with twenty years of experience."
  },
  {
   "a": 75.473,
   "b": 82.728,
   "text": "What actually helped was simpler: who it is for, what it is for, and what must not change."
  },
  {
   "a": 82.61800000000001,
   "b": 92.761,
   "text": "Then a one-line wish got wrapped in role, background, goal, constraints, workflow... a tiny sketch inside ten frames."
  },
  {
   "a": 95.876,
   "b": 102.902,
   "text": "Next, we taught it how to think. The most famous line: let’s think step by step."
  },
  {
   "a": 103.06200000000001,
   "b": 109.617,
   "text": "If a path went wrong, turn back. If one path was not enough, branch into many."
  },
  {
   "a": 109.507,
   "b": 117.511,
   "text": "Some asked it to play five experts in a meeting. But painting five scholars in is not the same as holding one."
  },
  {
   "a": 120.456,
   "b": 128.313,
   "text": "In real products, every mistake earned another notice on the wall: no explanations, only the tags."
  },
  {
   "a": 128.473,
   "b": 137.3,
   "text": "One patch covered a crack and pulled open another. Replace every single quote with a double quote, and O’Connor breaks too."
  },
  {
   "a": 137.19,
   "b": 144.431,
   "text": "Later, the interface took over keeping the format. Whether the picture is true still needs a human eye."
  },
  {
   "a": 147.546,
   "b": 153.493,
   "text": "In 2024, models began to be trained to reason on their own."
  },
  {
   "a": 153.653,
   "b": 160.148,
   "text": "Writing out “step one, step two” often stopped helping, and sometimes got in the way."
  },
  {
   "a": 163.263,
   "b": 166.971,
   "text": "The question became: what can it actually see?"
  },
  {
   "a": 167.08100000000002,
   "b": 179.085,
   "text": "If it changed the wrong thing, perhaps it was not careless. It had only seen the old plans. Writing “read carefully” three times cannot add a page it never saw."
  },
  {
   "a": 182.03,
   "b": 191.067,
   "text": "By 2026, one team deleted more than eighty percent of its old prompt, and the work did not get worse."
  },
  {
   "a": 191.227,
   "b": 198.988,
   "text": "An iron rule like “never write comments” became a single line: follow the style already around you."
  },
  {
   "a": 199.148,
   "b": 203.315,
   "text": "The old constraints had been blocking... a better stroke."
  },
  {
   "a": 207.96,
   "b": 216.614,
   "text": "From here, a prompt becomes something with versions and tests: remove a rule, try again, keep what helps."
  },
  {
   "a": 216.989,
   "b": 220.203,
   "text": "Letting go does not mean saying nothing."
  },
  {
   "a": 220.56300000000002,
   "b": 230.548,
   "text": "What you hope to make, why it is worth making, what it must not cost, and what counts as good. Those are still yours to decide."
  },
  {
   "a": 230.523,
   "b": 238.872,
   "text": "The stronger the model, the less we should plan its every step, and the more clearly we should say what is worth doing."
  }
 ],
